Integrating this first-order rate law:
$\int_{P_{\mathrm{N}_{2} \mathrm{O}_{5}, 0}}^{P_{\mathrm{N}_{2} \mathrm{O}_{5}}(t)} \frac{-dP_{\mathrm{N}_{2} \mathrm{O}_{5}}}{P_{\mathrm{N}_{2} \mathrm{O}_{5}}} = \int_{0}^{t} k dt$
